  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/07/IMG_7660.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La tarde de este martes se ha celebrado en Onda la festividad de la Virgen del Carmen, con el rezo del Rosario, el Ejercicio de la siete alegr&iacute;as, misa a las 20 horas en el Santuario de Nuestra Se&ntilde;ora de la Esperanza, y procesi&oacute;n por todo el paraje, con cantos infantiles y m&uacute;sica, bajo la direcci&oacute;n de Ignacio Pej&oacute; Us&oacute;.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processodiavergedelcarme/img_7616.jpg\" alt=\"img_7616\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processodiavergedelcarme/img_7617.jpg\" alt=\"img_7617\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processodiavergedelcarme/img_7618.jpg\" alt=\"img_7618\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processodiavergedelcarme/img_7619.jpg\" alt=\"img_7619\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processodiavergedelcarme/img_7620.jpg\" alt=\"img_7620\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processodiavergedelcarme/img_7621.jpg\" alt=\"img_7621\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processodiavergedelcarme/img_7622.jpg\" alt=\"img_7622\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processodiavergedelcarme/img_7623.jpg\" alt=\"img_7623\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processodiavergedelcarme/img_7624